-- Type inference (D007), ground case: no signatures; types determined by the
-- composition. `id` appears APPLIED (`id 7`), so it ground-infers to `Int`
-- here — no polymorphic ambiguity. Exercises inference through application.
--
--   `answer` : Int             (inferred from `id 7`)
--   `main`   : Eff Unit Unit    (inferred)
--
-- Expected: exit code 7

import I.Linux.Syscalls as S

answer = id 7

main = exit@S answer
